{"comment_text": {"ja18:0.1": "", "ja18:0.2": "", "ja18:0.3": "", "ja18:0.4": "", "ja18:1.1": "A goat is being prepared for a sacrifice as an offering for the departed, but it startles with its alternate laughing and weeping. It turns out, it laughs because it knows its bad kamma is about to be expiated, and it weeps because it knows the sacrificer will suffer as he has. Goat sacrifice was known since Vedic times (Rig Veda 1.162, Śatapatha Brāhmaṇa 6.2.1.2). ", "ja18:1.2": "", "ja18:1.3": "", "ja18:1.4": "", "ja18:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja18:0.1": "<article id='ja18'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja18:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja18:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja18:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja18:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja18:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja18:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja18:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja18:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja18:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja18:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja18:0.3": "Sīlavagga ", "ja18:0.4": "8. Matakabhattajātaka ", "ja18:1.1": "“Evañce sattā jāneyyuṁ, ", "ja18:1.2": "dukkhāyaṁ jātisambhavo; ", "ja18:1.3": "Na pāṇo pāṇinaṁ haññe, ", "ja18:1.4": "pāṇaghātī hi socatī”ti. ", "ja18:2.1": "Matakabhattajātakaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja18:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 18 ", "ja18:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja18:0.3": "Ethics ", "ja18:0.4": "The Feast for the Dead: a past life story ", "ja18:1.1": "If beings only knew ", "ja18:1.2": "how this suffering is created by birth, ", "ja18:1.3": "no creature would kill another, ", "ja18:1.4": "for the slayer of creatures grieves. ", "ja18:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja18:0.1": "", "ja18:0.2": "", "ja18:0.3": "", "ja18:0.4": "", "ja18:1.1": "ms22J_38, msdiv18, pts-vp-pli1.168", "ja18:1.2": "", "ja18:1.3": "", "ja18:1.4": "", "ja18:2.1": "ms22J_39"}, "keys_order": ["ja18:0.1", "ja18:0.2", "ja18:0.3", "ja18:0.4", "ja18:1.1", "ja18:1.2", "ja18:1.3", "ja18:1.4", "ja18:2.1"]}